    "Name": "Eyleuka",
    "Details": "The 45B was a limited offering that replace the MML-9 with a snub-nose PPC and additional heat sinks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
